      },
      "text": "Section 1. E sta blish m en t o f  B oard. There is established, effective September 9, \n1988, a board of three members to be appointed by the President to investigate \nthis dispute. No member shall be pecuniarily or otherwise interested in any  \norganization of railroad employees or any carrier. The Board shall perform its \nfunctions subject to the availability of funds."
    },
    {
