        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1988-09-13/pdf/FR-1988-09-13.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. R eport. The Board shall report its findings to the President with respect \nto the dispute within 30 days after the date of its creation."
